site-plan binding 0: this plan names no view, so the visual review has no declared vantage to judge the silhouette from and the render beside the reference sheet has nothing to frame. The plan still builds; what is missing is the picture the whole was supposed to be looked at in.
site-plan binding 0: this plan declares no whole-owned volume, so the check that keeps the whole's mass out of the places examined nothing. A map made only of rooms is a legitimate map; a map with a mountain in it that forgot to say so is not, and nothing else would notice.
